  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Size &amp; FitStandard fit is athletic and relaxed\n\nProduct Features\nFull-zip design with a two-way zip and spacious hood for versatile styling and coverage\nFan-favorite Tech Fleece material for polished warmth and comfort without the bulk\nReflective Nike Futura logo and screen-printed Air Max graphics supply sleek heritage style\nArticulated paneling for enhanced ease of mobility without snags or restrictions\nSignature tape-reinforced Tech sleeve pocket on the sleeve for subtle storage space\nBinding at the hem and cuffs personalizes the fit and seals out the cold53% cotton, 47% polyester\nMachine wash\nThe Nike Tech Fleece Air Max Full-Zip Windrunner Jacket is imported.\nTop off your look in impeccable style and comfort with the Men's Nike Tech Fleece Air Max Full-Zip Windrunner Jacket. The streamlined fit, full-zip design, and lightweight, premium Tech Fleece warmth with a smooth finish keep things versatile and fresh, allowing you to transition seamlessly from workouts to weekend plans without missing a beat. Effortlessly stylish and endlessly comfortable, this jacket is your new go-to for elevated athleisure, any time of year.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Tech Fleece Air Max Full-Zip Windrunner Jacket</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style